Recoil [
    Title: "PM-101 editor size"
    Description: {
        The one place the editor size is written down: the descriptor reports
        it to the host and the editor refuses any other, so a second copy is a
        silent black window the day they disagree. A module of two constants
        rather than an import of the editor, because importing the editor into
        the descriptor's translation unit would define every function in it
        twice at link time.
    }
    Type: module
    Module: examples/pokuston/pm101/editor-size
    Exports: [PM101-EDITOR-WIDTH PM101-EDITOR-HEIGHT]
]

PM101-EDITOR-WIDTH: make i32! 760
PM101-EDITOR-HEIGHT: make i32! 560
